OL,3,GNEWSAWhat happens to racehorses when
OL,4,Athey retire?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile ex-footballers sometimes quip
OL,7,Fthey are a long time retired, the same
OL,8,Falso applies to racehorses.
OL,10,FBut what happens once a thoroughbred
OL,11,Fhorse has finished its time galloping
OL,12,Fover the turf at racecourses across the
OL,13,Fcountry?
OL,15,FOne option for former racehorses is to
OL,16,Fbe retrained and go on to compete in
OL,17,Fequestrian disciplines, such as
OL,18,Fdressage and showjumping.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
