OL,3,GNEWSAWhat happens to racehorses when
OL,4,Athey retire?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 350 such horses are competing in
OL,7,Fa special event at Aintree Racecourse
OL,8,Fin Merseyside this week, organised by a
OL,9,Fretired racehorse charity.
